font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "48bc4819-b363-5b3a-8d5b-a51bcfc5814d"))(text "J1.2 = GAPTEC pin 5 = boost GND = Howland -40 V\nJ2.2 = signal ISO_GND = Howland GND\nDo not join MID to HV_BOTTOM. Each channel stays isolated." (at 27.94 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "30d7a902-b9d2-568a-b977-4cb643cf5d13"))(text "R3 is provisional. Feedback is BEFORE R3.\n5 mA DC imbalance causes about 0.25 V midpoint shift.\nC3/C4 are nominal 10u; verify bias-dependent capacitance." (at 154.94 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ecb7d085-f667-5fcf-ae74-395036f7053d"))(text "C5 filters the internal E/D pullup; E/D_COM ties to HV_BOTTOM.\nSTATUS is intentionally unused. EP pin 9 must solder to HV_BOTTOM.\nC6 must be directly beside U1 supply pins on the eventual PCB." (at 27.94 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6e571a0c-3f13-5e81-af9d-c06ed8976087"))(text "Required before release: loop/step-load validation, startup and\nshutdown, load imbalance and thermal tests, protection, exact BOM,\nPCB isolation/layout review. ERC success does not validate stability." (at 154.94 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c0b6604a-005e-5aff-ba26-fe0508dc087e"))(text "R1/R2: 16 mW each at 80 V; 32 mW total. Divider tolerance alone: +/-40 mV at MID.\nAssume one channel, +/-5 mA midpoint imbalance for initial evaluation. This is not a validated load limit." (at 27.94 161.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "929b6543-cae3-5835-90fe-6da16db1b5ce")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))